        <p source="#source-6133-6205"><seg source="#source-6133-6169">昭和二十五年十月二十五日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-6169-6205" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(3)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=3"><seg source="#source-6199-6205">著者</seg></seg></p>
